window.products.push({"id":523181,"name":"Ucharge Solar Led Light Warm Lights 10led 11ft Outdoor Solar Fairy String Lights Globes for Patio, Lawn, Garden, Yard, Home, Party, Holiday, Christmas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ivRWtPo6L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"This wonderful outdoor and indoor use string light is an Environment-friendly products, converting the solar energy into electricity and high energy conversion rate sealed process. It built in 600mah NIMH replaceable battery, and is solar charged the only. Put under sunshine during the day, and it begins to light up at night automatically. 2 different modes: flash and steady on. Perfect for indoor and outdoor decoration, such as gardens, patio, lawn, porch, gate, yard, etc. Specifications: Light color:warm white, Charging time:8hours. Working time:6-8hours,total working time more than 10,000hours. Switch: power on/off . Led quantity: 10pcs . Globe diameter: 0.13ft(40mm) . Flash mode:steady on or flashing . Solar panel: 2V 100MA. Working temperature: -20degree -60degree . Total Length of String: 3.35m(11ft) . Attention: The work time will be effect by the weather condition,the season and the location.It is normal, because the conversion efficiency of solar panel is effected by the light intensity. The lamp string will be charged only it's in \"on\" mode. It is waterproofed, but limited by rain and moisture.(it can not stay too long in the water.) Huge impact and knock must be avoided, otherwise, it will be damaged. One side of the spike is very sharp, please be carefully when you are using.STAY IT AWAY FROM CHILDREN AS IT IS SHARP. Package Included: 1 x Solar Panel ,1 x 21 cm Spike ,1 x 10 LED Solar String Morocco Globe Lights . Package size: 6.7*3.15*3.55inch","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ivRWtPo6L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon marketplace","source_asin":"B00WWI5DBE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WWI5DBE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WWI5DBE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":523182,"name":"Cutting Board Holder, Plate Holder, Plate Rack, Kitchen Organizer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZZDwwNs0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you have an extra thick cutting board? Or maybe an extra thin one? Maybe muffin trays or baking dishes of different sizes? Everyone has these utensils in their kitchens. In the past this meant that you would always end up with a rack that fit some items, but others would be bulging over, or wedged out. Our Kitchen Organizer uses a unique design to allow you to customize the configuration to match your personal usage completely. With the Cutting Board Holder it doesn't matter what size your item is, you can fit the width perfectly and it will always stand up straight and be simple to pull out and put away for drying or just for organizing your kitchen. Keep your kitchen counter, cabinets, pantry, and drawers hassle-free with our exclusive Kitchen Pantry and Cabinet Organizer. It is custom made of sturdy iron with a airy base. It is easy to clean and has an elegant platinum finish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZZDwwNs0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OFXDD","source_asin":"B07GM3XJS4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523182","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GM3XJS4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GM3XJS4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
