window.products.push({"id":523184,"name":"Mrs. Anderson’s Baking Creme Brulee and Cooking Torch, 42ml Capacity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TgBzVy6VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mrs. Anderson's Cooking Torch browns, caramelizes and sears foods quickly and precisely. Its adjustable settings allow you to fully customize the flame as needed, up to a maximum temperature of 2400 DegreeF. The refillable butane canister has a 42ml capacity (butane gas not included) and delivers up to 80 minutes of burn time. The removable BPA-free stand holds the torch conveniently nearby and a safety latch on the ignition meets CPSC child-safety requirements. Kitchen torches can be used for much more than just caramelizing sugar on creme brulee. Add more visual appeal to foods or deepen their flavors and transform everyday dishes into something really spectacular. Toast other sugary foods like marshmallows for s'mores, icings on cupcakes or meringue pies and baked alaska. Melt and toast cheese toppings for crispy macaroni and cheese, garlic bread or artisan pizza. Melt and brown cheese on French onion soup safer than navigating brimming bowls into, and out of, the broiler. Char vegetables, like roasted peppers, onions or tomatoes, faster than roasting in the oven, plus you can direct the flame precisely where it's needed. The powerful flame is perfect for larger, non-food tasks, like electrical and mechanical repairs, DIY projects, jewelry making, soldering and welding. It's compact and portable - keep one handy in your garage or take along as part of your camping gear or other travel and vacation supplies. Made with a sturdy aluminum body with removable BPA-free stand, Mrs. Anderson's Cooking Torch wipes down quickly with a damp cloth and easily stores away in your kitchen cabinet or drawer. Instructions for use are included. Brought to you by HIC Harold Import Co.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TgBzVy6VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mrs. Anderson's Baking","source_asin":"B01726HAYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01726HAYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01726HAYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
