window.products.push({"id":523201,"name":"Instant Read Meat Thermometer for Cooking |Waterproof Dual Probe Meat Thermometer for Kitchen Oven Smoker Deep Fry Grill BBQ Candy Cooking with Backli","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FbGRtL4UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥♨️- 2022 Meat Thermometer]: 304 stainless steel barbecue thermometer dual probe designs can prevent you from being scalded when measuring food. You can use the probe in the oven, the wires are sturdy and allow the oven door to close completely. Kitchen thermometer the foldable probe allows you to easily store it when not in use. 🍖♨️-[Digital Meat Thermometer Fast & Accurate]:2-3 second readings with ±1°F accuracy with a wide range of -58℉-572℉. Takes out the guesswork and eliminate overdone or undercooked food, ensuring you get the best flavor.And presses for 2 second to switch the temperature between Celsius and Fahrenheit. The food thermometer has a backlight function, which is more convenient to use. 🔥♨️-[Food Thermometer Design]:Food thermometer uses cr2450 international standard battery, which is three times the battery capacity of other common meat thermometers cr2032.Large LCD backlight screen, it lets you see the temp clearly both in dim kitchen and bright outdoors. It also has a corkscrew with large hanging hole and an internal magnet for storage. 🍖♨️-[Grill Thermometer Alarm Function]: The Meat Thermometer can set different temperatures according to different types of meat. At present, we have set 4 types of beef, lamb, turkey,veal etc., and also support custom settings. This set temperature has a memory function, after you set it again, you do not need to reset the temperature every time. When the food reaches the specified set temperature, the barbecue thermometer will sound an alarm to remind you. 🔥♨️-[IP67 Waterproof Meat Thermometer]: A strong ABS body with IP67 waterproof certification, This meat thermometer can be washed under running water, it also withstands accidental drops or other kitchen accidents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FbGRtL4UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leilanycol","source_asin":"B09HHDK6XQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HHDK6XQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HHDK6XQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
