window.products.push({"id":523209,"name":"Agreatca Computer Desk with Storage Shelves 55 Inch, Reversible Study Writing Table with Adjustable Bookshelf、File Bag、Wood Monitor Stand for Home Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tmecyDlPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✪Compact But Spacious: Agreatca computer table dimensions approx 55\"L *23.6\"W *48\"H. Compact but spacious enough for you working. Large size workstation provides ample storage for your monitors, books, plants, and lamp ✪Stable & Sturdy Structure: This writing desk perfectly combines hard steel, excellent density board, metal X-bar components, and adjustable anti-slip foot pads to ensure perfect balance on uneven ground and provide stability, which can hold up to 110lbs ✪Reversible storage shelf and file bag: A computer desk with 4 storage shelves provides enough space to store books, consoles, and office supplies. The bookshelf can also be set on the left or right according to your preferences. High-quality file bags can be used to store documents or office materials ✪Multifunctional Computer Shelf: The computer stand is made of a high-quality heavy-duty MDF board, Bearing 33LBS, which raises the monitor to eye level for a comfortable viewing experience. Looking down at the computer screen will save you from eye and neck fatigue. You can also use it to put the host box (due to the traditional rivet design structure, there may be some looseness after installation, but it does not affect normal use) ✪100% Satisfaction Guarantee: Fast 24-hour online customer service response service. For any reason, our desk cannot meet your needs. From accessories replacement, installation instructions, replacement, return and product update suggestions, we will provide you with the most suitable Service. Don't wait any longer and enjoy it now","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tmecyDlPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Agreatca","source_asin":"B08Y5M76C2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y5M76C2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y5M76C2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":523210,"name":"IKUK Porcelain Lining/Stainless Steel Thermos, 10-Ounce Vacuum Insulated Beverage Bottle/Travel Mug with Flip Top Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zzgsomKTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Does your thermal bottle smell funky and taste like metal? Do you worry about BPA when you drink from plastic water bottles? Have you ever broken a glass thermos when you are on the go? Here comes IKUK, equipped with the latest cutting-edge technology that combines a porcelain interior with a stainless-steel exterior. Its porcelain interior maintains the original flavor of your favorite beverages and avoids residual odor, while its stainless-steel exterior makes for great durability and keeps the bottle cold to the touch. IKUK Porcelain Thermos also comes with a double-wall vacuum insulation so that your drink stays hot for up to 6 hours and cold for up to 12 hours. This is the only product in the market that overcomes the drawbacks of all other thermos materials: healthier than plastic, more durable than glass, and less intrusive in flavor than stainless steel. ◎SINGLE-PIECE MOLDED PORCELAIN WITH NO LINING: After long-term usage, the linings in stainless steel containers may erode and release heavy metals into foods and beverages. The IKUK porcelain technology makes safety our priority, avoiding this health hazard through a kiln-fire single-piece molding method that creates no lining. ◎AUTHENTIC PORCELAIN INSTEAD OF THIN CERAMIC COASTING: Hard-white porcelain created from a 1300°C firing process, superior than low-grade ceramic created from a lower temperature (800°C). Much finer than a fragile layer of ceramic spray paint, our authentic hard-paste porcelain ensures that you won’t be consuming any chemicals due to scraps in your bottle. 【OTHER DETAILS】 ◎ A Unique Handle Design: The flexible carrying handle is made of reinforced silicon, can be easily stored on the lid when not in use, and can be used to carry the bottle when you are on the go. Guaranteed to support up to 11 pounds. Available on the Series of IKHI-360, IKHV-360, IKHI-520.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zzgsomKTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IKUK","source_asin":"B07P9W9MJD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P9W9MJD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P9W9MJD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
