window.products.push({"id":523281,"name":"MASTER QUEEN Dish Soap Dispenser for Kitchen - Refillable Liquid Soap Dispenser with Sponge Holder for Kitchen Sink - Premium Quality Removable Pump W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xmIzk+glL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Innovative Design : Compared with the sponge holder for sink , the lid has a better locking function, when the sponge is pushed down, the top will not fall and loosen. And a small green bead is attached to the pump, which perfectly prevents the water absorbed in the sponge from dripping onto the container. Kitchen Soap Dispenser With Sponge Holder : High quality, rustproof, exclusive 2 in 1 design, combining soap dispenser with a sponge holder. And clear look make dish-cleaning easier and cleaner, you are able to see the soap level. Easy To Use : Hand Operation, just only need press down on the top plate to dispense soap directly on to the sponge, extremely easy to use. You can fill it up with 13 oz of your favorite dish soap, and the dish soap will not get stuck in the pump ,you can easily squeeze out the soap ,work very smoothly. Keep Your Kitchen Sink Clean : No more messy spills, dripping, or trailing. You can put sponges, scrubbers, wipes, and scouring pads in a convenient place, while keeping the kitchen counter water. Save Money, Space and Time : It's a huge container and you don't have to refill it frequently as it stores a generous amount of liquid soap, you can refill the soap according to your needs, it really saves soap use for its pump design, and the instant operation will save your time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xmIzk+glL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MASTER QUEEN","source_asin":"B08JQGKKLT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523281","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JQGKKLT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JQGKKLT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
