window.products.push({"id":523307,"name":"Mugvana I'm Not Like a Regular Mom I'm a Cool Mom Funny Gift Coffee Mug (15oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eQfSNaXAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MUGVANA PREMIUM QUALITY COFFEE MUGS DURABLE: What makes the difference between our mugs and our competitors? We inspect every single mug for the upmost quality before sending that special gift out to ensure that each purchase meets our high quality standards. We use a double coated mug which is two time more durable than other mugs, making it stronger and last longer including putting it through several different test environments like multiple dishwasher and microwave cycles. In addition to that our mugs have a large wide C-Handle which makes it extremely comfortable to hold especially when filled with liquid. QUALITY: We use a high definition printing process that embeds the ink directly into the pores of the ceramic meaning that your mug design will never peel, crack or fade. Our mugs are proven to withstand over 3000+ dishwasher cycles and still leave a brilliant vibrant design that will catch anyone’s attention. The image will last for more than 10 years with the proper care. This unique printing technique is more durable and longer lasting then other companies that use vinyl stickers for their designs that can easily peel away after multiple cycles through the dishwasher. PERFECT GIFT: We provide a plethora of designs for all types of occasions and our catalogue is growing every day. Mugs make the perfect gifts all year round and for any occasion that you're looking for. Whether you're looking to add to your own home collection or to send as a gift our mugs make the right choice for him, her, mom, dad, men, women, work, school, professions, anniversaries, weddings, birthdays, holidays, or just because. In addition to that we pack each mug meticulously in a beautiful 100% recycled gift box so no matter what the occasion or group purchase each mug will be ready to be given as a gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eQfSNaXAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mugvana","source_asin":"B072MNYFGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072MNYFGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072MNYFGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
