window.products.push({"id":523329,"name":"Capresso FrothXpress Automatic Milk Frother, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41J4SPQDMHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description The only automatic hot milk frother that delivers frothy hot milk and hot chocolate in seconds! It's fast... it's easy... it's safe and... it's fun! 1. Turn frothXpress on and let heat up for two minutes. 2. Fill water container. 3. Fill milk container and attach to the frothXpress. 4. Place cup underneath spout. 5. Push and hold the Safety Steam Button. Immediately, frothXpress releases hot frothed milk. 6. Release the Safety Steam Button. frothXpress continues to froth for approximately 2 to 8 seconds to de-pressurize the machine. 7. Remove your cup and repeat steps 4 through 6 with as many cups as you want. 8. Store the milk container in refrigerator and clean frother parts under running water. 9. Add coffee to your cup(s) and enjoy. Features and Benefits: - Safety Steam Button. - Child Safety. When \"frother assembly\" is detached from machine, steam output is automatically blocked off. - Adjustable milk temperature (120° to 170°F). - Stainless Steel ThermoBlock (no water or steam come in contact with aluminum). - Thermostat keeps system in stand-by for immediate frothing. - 1220 Watt power for continuous action. - Removable water container for easy filling. - Can process up to 30 oz. of milk without refilling water container. - Great for producing hot, frothy chocolate. - On/Off and Thermostat indicator lights. - Complete with external milk container. - Easy to clean frother assembly. - How Things Work: - Milk Temperature - For maximum flow-through of milk the knob of the frother assembly sits parallel to the joint. When turning the knob slightly, the flow of milk is slowed down and the steam can increase the milk temperature. PRODUCT SPECS: Name/Model #: frothXpress, model # 201 Colors: black/silver Wattage/Volt/Hz: 1220 W/120V/60Hz Weight and Dimensions (H, W, L) 3.5 lbs. 9\" x 9\" x 9\" 1 Year Limited Warranty for Household Use UL Listed Amazon.com If you're a fan of cappuccinos, lattes, hot chocolate, or other drinks that use hot, frothy milk (and really, who isn't?), then Capresso's FrothXpress should become an indispensable part of your kitchen collection. After it's been turned on and warmed up for two minutes, it's easy to use. Just fill the water tank (which is in the actual machine), then fill the milk tank (which is a separate unit), and attach them. From that moment, it's just a matter of putting a cup under the spout and pressing the button--voilà, steamed frothy milk for a variety of treats. The milk temperature is adjustable from 120 to 170 degrees F, and the frother has 1,220 watts of power, as well as a stainless-steel ThermoBlock that ensures the aluminum parts don't touch the steam, a nice safety feature. The FrothXpress measures 8-3/4 by 6-1/2 by 8-3/4 inches (length by width by height), and looks sharp in gleaming bright black plastic. --A.J. Rathbun","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41J4SPQDMHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Capresso","source_asin":"B00005B5D6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005B5D6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005B5D6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
