window.products.push({"id":523371,"name":"CCTFS Stretch Jacquard Dining Chair Seat Covers Upholstered Anti-Dust Removable Washable Chair Protector Seat Cushion Slipcovers Set of 4, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717juCkUzUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It adopts high-quality elastic fabric, soft texture, active printing and dyeing process,natural and healthy, not easy to fade, and durable. Suitable for Chair Seat Size : 1.Seat length: 14.0-20.0 inches(35-50cm); 2.Seat width: 14.0-20.0 inches(35-50cm); 3.Seat cushion thickness: 1.5-3inches(3.8-7.6cm). Kindly Note : - Installation is very convenient. 1.Cover the seat cushion; 2.Turn the chair over and place it on the ground sideways; 3.At the bottom of the seat, buckle the white elastic bands in turn, in a cross shape. - Refer to recommended Chair Size as shown . Package Included:Seat Cover *4","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717juCkUzUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CCTFS","source_asin":"B08ND5RPV8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ND5RPV8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ND5RPV8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":523372,"name":"HOMICHEF WHOLE FOOD Steamer Insert without Lid (Nickel Free Stainless Steel) / Universal Steamer Inserts for Pots/Vegetable Steamer Insert for Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vd7umqshL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"WHOLE FOOD STEAMING IS THE BEST WAY OF COOKING 1. Steaming Whole Food (whole chicken, whole veggies, whole lobster, etc.) by wrapping it with hot vapor in an enclosed space is the best way of cooking: retains nutrition without loss of flavor.2. This elegant mirror polished steamer set includes 9.5\" steamer insert, 8\" steam pot, and 9.5\" glass lid, easily meets a whole family's (4-6 people) daily need.3. Features 3 graduated ridges for better steaming results, and to fit many pots you already own.4. Great for cooking veggies, pasta, chicken, seafood, etc. 3 GRADUATED RIDGES ON THE DEEP AND LARGE STEAMER FOR BETTER STEAMING & BETTER FITS 1. 3 graduated ridges fit 9.5\" / 9\" / 8\" tapered or straight pots and allow for a stable placement.2. Tapered 3-ridge design concentrates heat at bottom and creates the elevated steaming surface, ensuring quick and even heating.3. Perforated & 3-ridge design makes it fast and easy to drain water. NICKEL FREE HARM FREE 1. Unlike most nickel-bearing 18/8 (Cr: Ni) and 18/10 stainless steel cookware on the market, our product is healthier because it contains no nickel, which is harmful to health.2. Stainless steel cooking surface does not react with food or alter flavors. FAQs 1. Nickel-bearing 18/8 (Cr: Ni) or 18/10 stainless steel, being more corrosion-resistant, is commonly used for industrial purposes, but nickel is high up on the ATSDR list of priority toxins. Our nickel free steamer is made of food grade JYH21CT (21/0, Japanese Standard) stainless steel, which is non-toxic, non-allergic, thus more suitable for cookware.2. Oven safe & Dishwasher safe.3.Compatible with a 24 CM (9.5\") lid (included). ATTENTION 1. Prolonged exposure to acidic or basic substances may corrode stainless steel cookware.2. Do not use metal scouring pads or abrasive cleaners, they will scratch the surface.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vd7umqshL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMICHEF","source_asin":"B0722QHKZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0722QHKZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0722QHKZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":523373,"name":"Le Chef 3 Piece Enamel Cast Iron Nonstick Skillet Set, Palm.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LISjgtY+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Le Chef 3 piece enamel cast iron skillet set has a reinforced ceramic surface that prevents rust with no toxic fumes, even when using high heat. The cast iron retains and transmits heat quickly and evenly for perfect browning without needing to use a maximum heat setting. The riveted stainless steel handles with a plastic coat keep the handles cool touching the stove top. Durable finish requires no seasoning and is very easy to clean. Riveted hollow stainless steel handle stays cool. No harmful chemicals or toxic fumes. Safe on all cook tops and in the oven to 475 degrees F. Hand washing is recommended. Specifications: 8” Round Skillet: Length 15 1/2\" x Diameter 8\" x Depth 1 1/2\". 10” Round Skillet: Length 17\" x Diameter 10\" x Depth 1 1/2\". 12” Round Skillet: Length 18 1/4\" x Diameter 11 1/2\" x Depth 2\". Country of Origin: China.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LISjgtY+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Chef","source_asin":"B00946I3XW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00946I3XW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00946I3XW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
