window.products.push({"id":523513,"name":"Elyum Lunch Box, Lunch Bag Women/Men Large Insulated Lunch Bag with Adjustable Shoulder Strap, Leak Proof Cooler Bag Reusable for Office Picnic Beach ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Te+CC0BYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIALS: The lunch box is made of high density water and stain resistant oxford fabric, food grade PEVA lining, EPE foam insulation and strong heavy duty metal zippers, well made, high quality, tear resistant and durable. LONG-TERM INSULATION: With a four-layer insulated design, our lunch bag is filled with 6mm thick insulated EPE foam inside to keep food or drinks cold/warm/fresh for hours. The seamless waterproof lining keeps you from worrying about leaks. If the drink spills, just wipe it off with a damp cloth or napkin. LARGE CAPACITY: The lunch box measures 11.8\"L x 9.1\"W x 9.1\"H and has a capacity of 15L, enough to hold 24 cans of cola (330ml). The lunch bag comes with 2 side mesh pockets and 1 outside pocket for utensils, cell phone, water bottle, etc. EASY CARRYING: The insulated lunch bag has a reinforced handle at the top and a detachable and adjustable shoulder that can be adjusted from 7.1\" to 24.8\", allowing you to carry it by hand, over the shoulder or cross-body. Soft padded shoulder strap ensures you carry it comfortably without hurting your shoulders. EXTENSIVE USE: Available for both men and women, this cooler bag is perfect for packing food and drinks for daily life, work, picnics, camping, travel or any outdoor activity. The stylish design allows it to be used on multiple occasions according to your preference.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Te+CC0BYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elyum","source_asin":"B0B51CYVGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523513","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B51CYVGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B51CYVGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":523514,"name":"Map of The World Watercolor by Michael Tompsett, 30x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LEC+hhxGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a colorful watercolor world map. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies after leaving University. After 12 highly enjoyable years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Michael Tompsett creates Urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LEC+hhxGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B017NHFY4O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017NHFY4O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017NHFY4O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":523515,"name":"SOFTSEA Metal Loft Bed with Desk and Shelve for Kids / Adults / Teens, Twin Loft Bed with Full-Length Guardrail No Box Spring Needed (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812YbV-hRbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This twin size metal loft bed with desk is made with sturdy metal and has a clean-cut silhouette that can be matched with any room decor. Designed with safety in mind, this loft bed comes with a ladder integrated into the frame that is easy to climb up and down. It also incorporates full-length guardrails to ensure your kid sleeps safely at night as well as 22 secured heavy-duty metal slats that provide ample support, stability and air circulation for the mattress (no foundation or box spring needed). With this collection, you can turn any space into a workstation, a reading nook or a craft area. Weight & Dimensions Overall Product Dimension: 78.1''L x 41.7'' W x 68.3'' H Detail Product Dimension：Please refer to the Size image Number of Package：1 Overall Product Weight：118lbs Weight Capacity Upper bed: 200LBS Desk: 125LBS Recommended Mattress Thickness：6\" Specifications: Product Type：Loft Bed Size：Twin Material：MDF+Metal Box Spring Required：No Number of Slats：22 Assembly Required：Yes Product Warranty：One year Notes: Manual measurement has been used,there may be some reasonable error. All the pictures are taken by actual samples, slight chromatic aberration may occur due to lighting or display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812YbV-hRbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOFTSEA","source_asin":"B08R9ZF7XQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R9ZF7XQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R9ZF7XQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":523516,"name":"Camellia Bees Knife and Fork Wall Art, Knife and Fork Sign, Kitchen Wall Decor, Wire Knife and Fork,Kitchen Wall Hanging (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-ewZ3AgfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"How to Hang Wire Signs on a Wall There are a number of different ways to hang the signs up, meaning you can choose the method most appropriate for your project. 1. Mounting with Nails  Mark the spot on your wall  Mark the spot on your wall where you want to hang the sign. Press your sign to the wall and move it around until you’re happy with the position.  Make marks on your wall where the nails will go Create small pencil marks on the wall that correspond with the holes in the back of your sign. To make sure the marks are accurate, use a tape measure to find the distance between them and compare them to the distance between the holes in your sign.  Hammer nails into the marked areas.  Grab a nail, hold it up against one of your marks and, with a hammer, gently pound it into the wall. Leave enough of the nail exposed that you can easily hang your sign on it. Repeat this for each mark.  Hang your sign on the nails. 2. For Glass, wood, marble, metal, plastic, ceramic tile - Using Adhesives  Mark the spot where you want to hang the sign  Choose the adhesive tape: You should choose transparent double sided adhesive tape to stick these wire sign on.   Using scissors , cut out the tape to fit the width of the sign. Transparent double sided adhesive tape, with protective film on one end. Peel the plastic sheet of the tape and stick it on the wall, then peel off the protective film and stick the sign on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-ewZ3AgfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Camellia Bees","source_asin":"B091TXMH9X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091TXMH9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091TXMH9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":523517,"name":"Ubiquiti Networks UVC-NVR-2TB UniFi Network Video Recorder with 2TB HDD & UniFi Video Software","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715+qbT-T+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ubiquiti UVC-NVR-2TB UniFi Plug & Play NVR Network Video Recorder Ubiquiti Networks UVC-NVR is a plug-and-play NVR appliance with low power consumption and offers UniFi Video’s powerful IP surveillance software. This nvr manages the UniFi Video Cameras and records video according to rules set up in the software. The UniFi Video software is pre-installed for quick and easy deployment. Therefore no additional software is required. The user has to plug the NVR into the network, go through the configuration wizard, and the installation is done. UVC-NVR features user-definable disk space and date-based auto purge to allow the user to keep a set amount of free disk space or automatically delete recordings after a certain number of days. Besides it also allows mapping external USB or network storage drives. This NVR can connect up to 50 UniFi Video Cameras and support cameras installed at multiple locations. It is equipped with the Intel D2550 processor. Ubiquiti Networks UVC-NVR comes with a Vertical Support Stand, Power Adapter (19V, 3.42A), Power Cord, Magnetic Rubber Feet (4), and a Quick Start Guide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715+qbT-T+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ubiquiti Networks","source_asin":"B076CPKZHX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076CPKZHX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076CPKZHX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
