window.products.push({"id":523866,"name":"athizay Brass Diyas Pack of 2 for Pooja Virgin Brass Indian Diya Set Oil lamp Sets for Gifting Home Decor to be Used with Cotton Wick or moli (Kamalde","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PfXcEXvZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3 inches is the petal diameter. brass and copper plated petals. This Pack of Oil Lamps are great for Home Puja | kirtan | Hawan decoration. Gold polish ; Style: Lotus shaped with oil container. This regular size Diya lamp is perfect for pooja room. Its easy to clean these diyas. You can use lemon and pitambari and rub it vigorously. Post that clean it with cotton cloth. If you don't have pitambari, use baking soda. Else final option is to use petrol Brass is truly timeless, classic and elegant in its appeal -athizay Cotton wick dipped in oil is used to light this.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PfXcEXvZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"athizay","source_asin":"B09QMRVP1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QMRVP1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QMRVP1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":523867,"name":"Pacific Coast Feather Sealy Best Fit 300-Thread-Count Cotton Sateen Queen Sheet Set, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31V9JRJAFGL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Patented Sealy Best Fit, fitted sheets really do fit any mattress up to 20 inches thick! Cotton spandex ends and full elastic all the way around the bottom of the fitted sheet is guarantee a snug fit on all standard and pillow-top mattresses. The flat sheets are oversized and the unique CaptureTop pillowcases offer a unique closure to hold your pillow in place. Sealy Best Fit Sheets are available in a variety of fashionable solid colors to coordinate with any décor. Machine wash and dry for easy home care. Since 1906, Sealy has delivered healthy, restful sleep to millions of people. Sealy knows that the beginning of a great day really starts the night before. That¿s why we specially design our bedding products to provide a healthy, restful sleep experience. Our high quality standards, innovative designs and skilled craftsmanship ensure we provide you with the best products possible for years of lasting comfort. Sealy helps you sleep right so you wake up refreshed and ready to take on the day. It¿s Made For Sleep. It¿s A Sealy. Amazon.com Luxurious to the touch and generous in dimension, these Best Fit sheets from Sealy Posturepedic upgrade your bed from sleep center to haven. The fitted sheet is specially designed to fit mattresses up to 20 inches thick, including hard-to-match models like those with pillow-tops and featherbeds. Its cotton spandex end panels deliver a secure grip and the edge is fully elastic. In a welcome departure from standard practice, the flat sheet in this set is amply oversized, allowing for extra comfort and coverage. The pillowcases feature an end pocket--Sealy calls this CaptureTop--that holds the pillow in place and keeps the case from slipping open or off. The whole set is 100 percent combed cotton sateen with 300 thread count and a non-pill design. Machine wash and dry them for easy care. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31V9JRJAFGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacific Coast Feather","source_asin":"B0000DIGWV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523867","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000DIGWV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000DIGWV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":523868,"name":"Trademark Fine Art Sea Life Coral II by Lisa Audit Fine Art, 14x14, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912IBuLbCyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a white silhouette of coral on a blue watercolor background. Lisa Audit is a Canadian artist with a love for nature and the world of decorating. Her artwork can be found, not only on the wall, but on many household items and everyday products around the home. While a majority of her earlier work was painted with oil on canvas, she has rediscovered the beauty of watercolors and has brought a fresh, clean, and inviting look to her artwork. In 2014, Lisa made the charming and inspiring town of Quebec city her home and looks forward to painting her love of nature and the outdoors for years to come. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912IBuLbCyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07D3MM841","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D3MM841","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D3MM841","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
