window.products.push({"id":523912,"name":"Crocon White Marble Coaster For Tea Coffee Cups Glass & Can Table Decor | Hexagon Coasters Set Of 4 | Alabaster Marble Coaster Set | Handmade Design F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z-R54V9XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨ WHITE MARBLE COASTER : The White marble coasters. each possesses a round shape and pattern. Mother nature has made each coaster distinctive in its own habit, size and thickness. Thickly made and assured to keep any surface clean, these designer coasters will bring a sense of value to any coffee break. The size in inch is 4x4x2 (10X10X5 cm) Approx. The Package Includes 4 Coasters. ✨ STONE COASTERS : Coasters are perfect for placing beneath teacups, wine glasses, tumblers and mugs. The coasters are thick to completely shield the tabletop beneath them. This Heat Resistant Coaster Adds Style And Utility To Your Living Space Preventing Furniture Damages, Scratches On Glass, Water Marks And Stains On Wooden Tables, Absorbs Spills, Keeping Your Dining Table Cloth Clean And Complete In Looks. ✨ POLISHED & UNIQUE : This heat resistant coaster adds style and utility to your living space preventing furniture damages, scratches on glass, water marks and stains on wooden tables, absorbs spills, keeping your dining table cloth clean and complete in looks.The gorgeous crystal stone enhances your home decor and brightens your room. The coaster set can be appreciated as marvelous art pieces but can also set off your drink ware such as coffee mugs or wine glasses. ✨ PERFECT GIFT : An eye catching accessory for your bar, dining table, or coffee tea lounge. You can also present this set to your friends as a housewarming gift. This royal piece of art simply shows that how can a simple work of art turns into a master piece of craftsmanship, Matches with any type of interior and gives classy touch. ✨ ATTENTION : If you receive a set that does not look exactly like the ones shown in the pictures, congratulations! You will not find two identical Handmade slices anywhere in the world and it only proves the point that they are purely handmade. They are perfect presents for housewarming parties, christmas,birthdays, wedding and holidays. Enjoy and appreciate the beauty the coaster set has to offer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z-R54V9XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crocon","source_asin":"B0BXF58847","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-523912","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXF58847","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXF58847","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
